    "html":  "\u003cdiv class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan typeof=\"mw:File\"\u003e\u003ca href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/queensblade/images/f/f2/Karin_Red_Sky%27s_Medium_Queen%27s_Blade_Unlimited_Limit_Break_.jpg/revision/latest?cb=20260106133543\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"\u003e\u003cimg alt=\"Karin Red Sky\u0026#39;s Medium Queen\u0026#39;s Blade Unlimited Limit Break \" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/queensblade/images/f/f2/Karin_Red_Sky%27s_Medium_Queen%27s_Blade_Unlimited_Limit_Break_.jpg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/400?cb=20260106133543\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"400\" height=\"968\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-image-name=\"Karin Red Sky\u0026#39;s Medium Queen\u0026#39;s Blade Unlimited Limit Break .jpg\" data-image-key=\"Karin_Red_Sky%27s_Medium_Queen%27s_Blade_Unlimited_Limit_Break_.jpg\" data-relevant=\"1\" /\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\n\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cb\u003eRed Sky\u0027s Medium\u003c/b\u003e\n\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eA priestess hailing from a faraway village, which she protects from magical beasts and evil spirits. She does so by using a relic that stores the energy of the setting sun and transform it into magical power.\n\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cdiv id=\"gallery-0\" hash=\"f6bfd105b5c889820f97e00c72f3aad6\" data-seq-no=\"0\" class=\"wikia-gallery wikia-gallery-caption-below wikia-gallery-position-left wikia-gallery-spacing-medium wikia-gallery-border-small wikia-gallery-captions-left wikia-gallery-caption-size-medium\"\u003e\u003cdiv class=\"wikia-gallery-caption\"\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003cdiv class=\"wikia-gallery-item\" style=\"width:187px; \"\u003e\u003cdiv class=\"thumb\" style=\"height:187px;\"\u003e\u003cdiv class=\"gallery-image-wrapper accent\" id=\"Karin_RSM_Crimson_Firebird_Queen-s_Blade_Unlimited_Limit_Break_-jpg\" style=\"position: relative; height:184px; width:90px; top:0.5px;\"\u003e\u003ca c